The PHP script requires the GET parameter "revelio" to be set before spitting
out the password.  Unfortunately, the script outputs an HTTP redirect response 
that should automatically send a browser back to "/" if you don't happen
to be an admin.  To get the output of the initial execution of the script,
you need to access the page without a browser or explicitly turn redirection
off.

